  "access": "Open access on DANDI (dandi:OpenAccess, CC-BY-4.0; cite the dataset and the data descriptor). BrainOS streams only pinned slices and never commits or re-hosts them.",
  "citation": "Peterson, Steven M.; Singh, Satpreet H.; Dichter, Benjamin; Scheid, Micheal; Rao, Rajesh P. N.; Brunton, Bingni W. (2022) AJILE12: Long-term naturalistic human intracranial neural recordings and pose (Version 0.220127.0436) [Data set]. DANDI archive. https://doi.org/10.48324/dandi.000055/0.220127.0436",
